  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Building Backend Services**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing the backend services, specifically `server/services/jobService.ts`. I\'m integrating multi-source job adapters to source jobs from various platforms. I have built adapters for `RemoteOKAdapter`, which handles live fetches from `https://remoteok.com/api` with an offline/rate-limited fallback, and a `GreenhouseAdapter`.\n\n\n**Expanding Job Sources**\n\nI\'m expanding the job source adapters to include `LeverAdapter` and `IndeedLinkedInAdapter`, both utilizing standardized parsers. I\'ve also added a custom search query adapter to allow searches by keyword, location, and role. I\'m focusing on deduplication using `source + externalId` and `company + title + location` to avoid redundant entries, and pre-filtering based on Section 10 rules. The focus is now on ingestion into the `db`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 291494181
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
