  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Key Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `ApplicationApprovalModal.tsx` component. This is the crucial Human-in-the-Loop element. I\'m building it to display job details like the company, title, URL, and match score. I\'m also ensuring the modal includes form fields extracted and populated by AI. These fields will cover personal information, education, work authorization, salary, and any custom-targeted data.\n\n\n**Refining Application Workflow**\n\nI\'m now integrating inline editing for any field within the application. I\'m also including a tailored cover letter preview with an inline editor and a tone switcher. A submission browser preview snapshot simulator is also in the works. The \"Approve & Submit\" button will trigger confetti, update the status to \"APPLIED\", dispatch a Telegram notification, and record an audit trail. I\'m also tackling the ApplicationView and JobView to enable a full Kanban Board and table view, filtering, and source ingestion.\n\n\n**Developing Agent Console**\n\nI\'ve been working on the `AgentConsoleView.tsx` component, which will be an autonomous ReAct Agent Live Runner. It will feature a goal prompt input, a step-by-step visual timeline of ReAct phases, and real-time streaming logs. I\'m also including a metrics summary.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Structuring Profile Data**\n\nI\'m now focusing on `ProfileView.tsx`. The plan is to include a resume upload functionality, with AI-driven structured extraction. I\'ll make the profile editable, with tabs for personal info, work history, education, projects, skills, and preferences.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Generating Cover Letters**\n\nI\'ve been building `CoverLettersView.tsx` to include a library of generated cover letters. This view will have a full text preview, a tone changer, copy-to-clipboard functionality, and a PDF download simulator.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Ingesting Email Data**\n\nI\'m also building `EmailMonitorView.tsx`. It will handle the ingestion of an email stream with an AI component.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 9
      nanos: 735449246
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
