  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the full-stack **AI Job Search & Application Agent**, implementing all features from your plan with server-side Gemini AI integration, real-time background automation, and strict human-in-the-loop safety controls.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities & Architecture\n\n- **Candidate Profile & AI Resume Studio**:\n  - Structured profile store containing work history, technical skills, target roles, salary bands, and company exclusion blacklists.\n  - Built-in Gemini resume parser that ingests raw text or LinkedIn exports and extracts structured accomplishments, timelines, and competencies.\n\n- **Multi-Source Job Ingestion & Deduplication**:\n  - Live job adapter supporting listings across RemoteOK, Greenhouse, Lever, and LinkedIn.\n  - Multi-tier deduplication engine normalizing companies, job titles, and external listing IDs.\n\n- **Gemini Job Match Evaluation**:\n  - Deep candidate-to-job matching matrix calculating fit percentages (0\342\200\223100%), matching competencies, skill gaps, and clear qualitative rationale.\n\n- **Truthful Cover Letter Studio**:\n  - Generates tailored cover letters citing verified experience and metrics with selectable tones (*Professional*, *Technical*, *Conversational*, *Enthusiastic*).\n\n- **Autonomous ReAct Agent Console**:\n  - Multi-step reasoning loop with live execution traces showing agent thoughts, tool selections, inputs/outputs, and decision gates.\n  - Automatic transition to `WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL` when an application package is prepared.\n\n- **Human-In-The-Loop Approval & Application Board**:\n  - 10-stage pipeline tracking (*Saved, Matched, Ready, Waiting Approval, Applied, Screening, Interview, Offer, Rejected, Withdrawn*) across Kanban and Table views.\n  - Interactive Review Modal displaying pre-filled form fields, custom question responses, and cover letter for 1-click verification and submission.\n\n- **Recruiter Email Monitor & Stage Sync**:\n  - Inbound email classifier categorizing recruiter messages (*Interview Invitations, Job Offers, Rejections, Screening*) with automatic status updates.\n  - Interactive simulator buttons to test live pipeline events.\n\n- **Real-Time Telegram Alerts & Background Scheduler**:\n  - Live Telegram bot integration for real-time mobile notifications on high-match discoveries, approval requests, submissions, and interview invitations.\n  - Configurable polling intervals and match thresholds.\n\n---\n\n### How to Connect External Services\n\n1. **Telegram Notifications (Optional)**:\n   - Go to the **Scheduler & Telegram** tab in the app.\n   - Open Telegram and message **@BotFather** to create a bot and get a **Bot Token**.\n   - Message **@userinfobot** or **@myidbot** on Telegram to get your **Chat ID**.\n   - Paste both values into the settings form, toggle alerts on, and click **Send Test Alert** to verify the link.\n\n2. **Gemini API**:\n   - Automatically connected via server-side environment configuration. You can customize model parameters and prompt templates directly in the settings."
    modified_response: "I have built the full-stack **AI Job Search & Application Agent**, implementing all features from your plan with server-side Gemini AI integration, real-time background automation, and strict human-in-the-loop safety controls.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities & Architecture\n\n- **Candidate Profile & AI Resume Studio**:\n  - Structured profile store containing work history, technical skills, target roles, salary bands, and company exclusion blacklists.\n  - Built-in Gemini resume parser that ingests raw text or LinkedIn exports and extracts structured accomplishments, timelines, and competencies.\n\n- **Multi-Source Job Ingestion & Deduplication**:\n  - Live job adapter supporting listings across RemoteOK, Greenhouse, Lever, and LinkedIn.\n  - Multi-tier deduplication engine normalizing companies, job titles, and external listing IDs.\n\n- **Gemini Job Match Evaluation**:\n  - Deep candidate-to-job matching matrix calculating fit percentages (0\342\200\223100%), matching competencies, skill gaps, and clear qualitative rationale.\n\n- **Truthful Cover Letter Studio**:\n  - Generates tailored cover letters citing verified experience and metrics with selectable tones (*Professional*, *Technical*, *Conversational*, *Enthusiastic*).\n\n- **Autonomous ReAct Agent Console**:\n  - Multi-step reasoning loop with live execution traces showing agent thoughts, tool selections, inputs/outputs, and decision gates.\n  - Automatic transition to `WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL` when an application package is prepared.\n\n- **Human-In-The-Loop Approval & Application Board**:\n  - 10-stage pipeline tracking (*Saved, Matched, Ready, Waiting Approval, Applied, Screening, Interview, Offer, Rejected, Withdrawn*) across Kanban and Table views.\n  - Interactive Review Modal displaying pre-filled form fields, custom question responses, and cover letter for 1-click verification and submission.\n\n- **Recruiter Email Monitor & Stage Sync**:\n  - Inbound email classifier categorizing recruiter messages (*Interview Invitations, Job Offers, Rejections, Screening*) with automatic status updates.\n  - Interactive simulator buttons to test live pipeline events.\n\n- **Real-Time Telegram Alerts & Background Scheduler**:\n  - Live Telegram bot integration for real-time mobile notifications on high-match discoveries, approval requests, submissions, and interview invitations.\n  - Configurable polling intervals and match thresholds.\n\n---\n\n### How to Connect External Services\n\n1. **Telegram Notifications (Optional)**:\n   - Go to the **Scheduler & Telegram** tab in the app.\n   - Open Telegram and message **@BotFather** to create a bot and get a **Bot Token**.\n   - Message **@userinfobot** or **@myidbot** on Telegram to get your **Chat ID**.\n   - Paste both values into the settings form, toggle alerts on, and click **Send Test Alert** to verify the link.\n\n2. **Gemini API**:\n   - Automatically connected via server-side environment configuration. You can customize model parameters and prompt templates directly in the settings."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
