    thinking: "**Exploring Job Agent Features**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the job agent. I\'ve begun to integrate live job fetching capabilities from sources such as RemoteOK (JSON API) and Arbeitnow (free live data). The goal is to build a robust and reliable agent. I plan to incorporate more real-time, multi-source job fetching to improve functionality.\n\n\n**Expanding Job Aggregation Sources**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into expanding the job aggregation capabilities. I\'m incorporating new sources like Hacker News\' \'Who is Hiring\' posts, Jooble, Adzuna, and GitHub jobs. I\'m also planning to ingest RSS feeds from We Work Remotely. A key feature will allow users to paste *any* job listing URL for instant scraping, parsing, and application preparation.\n\n\n"
