    thinking: "**Enhancing Data Sources**\n\nI\'m currently focused on expanding the agent\'s data ingestion capabilities. I\'m adding live sources: specifically, the RemoteOK and Arbeitnow APIs. These will provide a stream of current job postings, enriching the agent\'s data. Integrating these APIs is the priority.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Access**\n\nI\'ve made significant progress integrating several job APIs, including Remotive and a custom ingestion tool that handles various job board URLs and raw text. I\'ve also implemented a resume parser with drag-and-drop file upload capabilities. Gemini now extracts candidate details, allowing for direct editing of user profiles. Additionally, I\'ve designed a custom job ingestion modal, streamlining the process of adding jobs via URL or text, and matching them to the resume.\n\n\n"
