  planner_response {
    response: "I have finalized the end-to-end autonomous **AI Job Search & Application Agent**:\n\n### Functional Highlights\n\n- **Live Multi-Board Job Ingestion**: Aggregates live jobs in real time from public APIs including **RemoteOK**, **Arbeitnow**, and **Remotive**, alongside major ATS patterns (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby) and a dedicated **Custom Job URL / Description Importer**.\n- **Gemini AI Match Engine**: Evaluates candidate fit against job requirements with structured scoring (0\342\200\223100%), technical skill overlap highlights, identified requirement gaps, and deterministic pre-filters (excluded companies, experience barriers).\n- **Human-In-The-Loop Approval System**: Pre-synthesizes tailored form answers and honest cover letters (citing verified projects and achievements) with quick-copy clipboard actions and direct external portal launch buttons.\n- **Candidate Profile & Resume Studio**: Supports direct file uploads (`.txt`, `.md`, `.json`, `.pdf`, `.docx`), structured Gemini extraction, manual field editing, blacklisted company controls, and JSON export.\n- **Autonomous Agent Loop & Scheduler**: Multi-step reasoning cycle (Profile Verification $\\to$ Live Discovery $\\to$ Match Scoring $\\to$ Application Preparation) with configurable execution schedules.\n- **Email Recruiter Monitor**: Automated email classifier distinguishing interview invitations, status screenings, offers, and rejections with automatic application lifecycle updates.\n- **Real-Time Telegram Alerts**: Instant push notifications for new high-match positions, application approvals, and interview scheduling requests."
